al_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nRegression from #113574 [d09a3d83ffb6ba2a612724d24343432cb1031c82]\n\nCC @YeldhamDev \n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.beta1 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon 780M Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.22029.9039) - AMD Ryzen 7 8840HS w/ Radeon 780M Graphics (16 threads) - 15.28 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe localization remaps menu is broken since this change, as can be seen in the screenshots below\n\nBefore, the two lists of entries are visible:\n\n<img width=\"2347\" height=\"1484\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8937aa6-b1fd-4aea-a9ed-570e660c352b\" />\n\nAfter, the lists are all squashed:\n\n<img width=\"2308\" height=\"1460\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5c9a336d-3986-4982-9149-7c00ab3eae50\" />\n\nUnsure what specifically in this PR broke it, could be the change from `VBoxContainer` to `MarginContainer`\n\nThis effectively makes the remap editor unusable, the other localization editors seem to work correctly as they're not partitioned, went through the other editor interfaces changed in this PR and couldn't find any other regressions\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen Project Settings > Localization > Remaps\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gith